                        "equals": "kept"
                    },
                    {
                        "not": {
                            "flag": "packet_gone"
                        }
                    }
                ],
                "text": "It is not quite light. Tull is on the seventh step with the rope actually doing something, and the packet is low in the water with paper. \"Last one that makes the quarter-day,\" he says, and turns the book round so you can see the owners' page. Your name is on it, with a place kept. \"I go at the bell,\" he says. \"Either way.\"",
                "choices": [
                    {
