                            "equals": "kept"
                        }
                    }
                ],
                "text": "It is not quite light. Tull is on the seventh step with the rope actually doing something, and the packet is low in the water with paper. \"Last one that makes the quarter-day,\" he says. \"Full, for once. Town's business.\" He does not say whose.",
