            {
                "text": "The packet stair is green below the sixth step and dry above it, and there is a very large man sitting on the seventh with a rope in his hands he is not doing anything with. \"Second and the fifth,\" he says, without being asked. \"That's the sailing. Everyone comes down here to ask and it's chalked on the board behind me and nobody reads a board.\"",
