                        "flag": "vote_fate",
                        "equals": "proxy"
                    }
                ],
                "text": "Reed comes down the stair in the good coat with the strongbox under one arm and the proxy inside it. She does not look back at the town. Tull writes her in the book without asking her name, which you have never seen him do for anybody.",
