                "conditions": [
                    {
                        "flag": "vote_fate",
                        "equals": "against"
                    }
                ],
                "text": "\"Your vote's been in Mrs Crale's book a fortnight,\" Tull says. \"Never rode with me. Weighed nothing.\" He stows a sack. \"Funny how some paper you feel in the hold and some you don't.\"",
                "choices": [
                    {
