                        "flag": "costing_figure",
                        "equals": "read_first"
                    }
                ],
                "text": "Hesper Amsel comes down the stair with her measuring book in oilcloth and takes the seat in the stern without being shown it. \"I am going to hear it read,\" she says to nobody, and settles her coat, and does not open the book once.",
