            },
            {
                "conditions": [
                    {
                        "flag": "walked_fate",
                        "equals": "reasons"
                    }
                ],
                "text": "Tull lifts a single letter off the top of the sack and holds it up to the grey light. Your hand. Care of Mrs Crale, to be read under item seven. He puts it back on top, not in the sack. \"That one rides with me,\" he says.",
                "choices": [
                    {
                        "label": "Go on.",
                        "next": "packet_b"
                    }
                ]
            },
            {
                "conditions": [
                    {
                        "flag": "minute_fate",
                        "equals": "copied"
                    }
                ],
                "text": "Somebody has pinned a copy of the copy to the packet's mast, the reader-list too, crosses and all. Tull looks at it, decides it is cargo, and leaves it there.",
                "choices": [
