                        "label": "Go on.",
                        "next": "packet_b"
                    }
                ]
            },
            {
                "text": "Sacks, a crate of chain, the quarter's post. Nobody you know goes aboard. Tull loads it all himself and writes it all down, the same hand, the same speed.",
